  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Verification of expenses - CPT Maraba and Xinguara BRA517 and BRA551</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed work is to perform a verification of expenses in CPT Maraba and Xinguara&apos;s offices. The final product will be an expenditure verification report of BRA517 - support costs to the EU co-finananced project BRA516 (July 2012 - June 2015 - at a value of BR$ 526.139,11) and the first semester of BRA551 - CPT&apos;s post-EU project financed by CAFOD, (July 2015 - December 2015 - at an annual value of BR$ 435,922.65). The exercise will also analyse financial and accounting management systems in Xinguara and Maraba offices, along with recommendations to make them suitable to Brazilian legislative requirements, to facilitate the financial management of the CAFOD project. This consultancy is needed to abide by CAFOD&apos;s audit requirements, and will serve as a capacity building exercise.</narrative>
  </description>
